<title>USA: Alltrista to repurchase shares.</title>
<headline>Alltrista to repurchase shares.</headline>
<dateline>MUNCIE, Ind 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alltrista Corp said Thursday its board of directors authorized the repurchase of up to 600,000 shares, or about eight percent of the company's common stock.  </p>
<p>The company said it hopes to complete the repruchase by the end of the year.</p>
<p>&quot;The current program follows a similar effort last year, when 630,000 shares were repurchased, returning $14 million to our shareholders,&quot; Thomas Clark, chief executive of the consumer products and industrial components company, said in a news release.</p>
<p>Alltrista shares closed down 5/8 at 22 Thursday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
